{"site":"douban","sid":"6875863","imdb_id":"tt1979388","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1979388/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/6875863/","chinese_title":"恐龙当家","foreign_title":"The Good Dinosaur","year":"2015","aka":["善良的恐龙","恐龙大时代(港)","恐龙管家","美好的恐龙世界"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["喜剧","动画","家庭","冒险"],"language":["英语"],"playdate":["2015-11-25(美国)"],"episodes":"","duration":"93分钟","description":"6500万年前，一颗小行星与地球擦肩而过，称霸这个世界的恐龙懵懵懂懂地逃过了灭顶之灾。之后又过了数百万年，恐龙的智力得到进化，它们学会种植、畜牧、建筑，并且拥有属于自己的语言和家庭。某座山脚下的平原地带，雷龙一家迎来三个性格各异的娃娃，最小的阿洛（雷蒙德·奥乔亚 Ray mond Ochoa 配音）孱弱胆怯，与父亲的生离死别更在他的心中投下难以磨灭的阴影。一连串的事件过后，他与妈妈、哥哥、姐姐相隔万里。阿洛将这一切都归罪于原始人类的小孩点点（杰克·布赖特 Jack Bright 配音）。而点点似乎不为所动，他主动亲近阿洛，仿佛是一条忠诚勇敢的小狗。\n在充满坎坷和危险的回家之路上，阿洛与点点结伴而行，而这两个本不该碰面的恐龙和人类，将缔结超越了种族和时空的纯真友情……","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2267430045.jpg","douban_votes":"67726","douban_rating":"7.5","imdb_rating_average":"6.7","imdb_votes":"142514","imdb_rating":"6.7 / 10 from 142,514 users","director":[{"name":"彼得·孙 Peter Sohn","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27526287/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/4d64376d98fa828b761e39fa4fac5ea6.jpg"}],"writer":[{"name":"鲍勃·彼德森 Bob Peterson","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27522661/","role":"故事 Original Concept & Development by / Story","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/2e07a992b2315a7ca6262408ebe89e0e.jpg"},{"name":"彼得·孙 Peter Sohn","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27526287/","role":"故事 Story","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/4d64376d98fa828b761e39fa4fac5ea6.jpg"},{"name":"埃里克·本森 Erik Benson","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27575383/","role":"故事 Story","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"梅格·勒福夫 Meg LeFauve","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27517992/","role":"故事 / 剧本 Story / Screenplay","avatar":"https://img1